  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For the given circuit, in the steady state,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;_____ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7017686d-bdad-4b51-820c-fc11c8435595-bedf4c97-1956-478c-94d4-c8ed3ec3a995-9896274.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 398px;\" />&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7017686d-bdad-4b51-820c-fc11c8435595-bedf4c97-1956-478c-94d4-c8ed3ec3a995-9896274.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 398px;\" /></p><p>At steady state current will not pass through capacitor, therefore effective resistance between B and C will be only&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#937;</mi></math>. Modified circuit will be as shown below.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7be498af-efab-4dca-911e-cbba2330bfb7-9896274_2.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 205px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp; and&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>Applying Kirchoff&#39;s law along path BAD, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>.</p>",
